, entrerà in contatto con una gang di giovani ladri di strada diventandone presto il leader. Con il passare del tempo conoscerà amore, violenza e corruzione diventando un abile criminale, fino a che un giorno 15 anni dopo in città arriverà Loux, decisa a trovare il ragazzo che le aveva salvato la vita ed ignara della sua trasformazione."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Oscar, a young boy, commits a noble murder and is forced to runaway from his rural hometown, leaving behind his best friend, Loux. He escapes to the nearest city, where he is inducted into a gang of child street thieves. His innocence slips away as he is introduced to love, murder, and corruption. 15 years later, he has forgotten his past and become the leader of this band of lost children. When Loux moves to the city in search of work, she takes a job with a struggling private investigator. Stumbling upon Oscar's missing child report, she takes it upon herself to find the boy who saved her life.","tagline":"Their only law is family."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5S2dZll4ScmJ2tk7LjZNjMRYZ9T.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wF7xPb1qB1Q3Tu39JrCNOvP70vB.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":591774,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5S2dZll4ScmJ2tk7LjZNjMRYZ9T.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5S2dZll4ScmJ2tk7LjZNjMRYZ9T.jpg","language":"it","width":533,"height":800},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5S2dZll4ScmJ2tk7LjZNjMRYZ9T.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5S2dZll4ScmJ2tk7LjZNjMRYZ9T.jpg","language":"it","width":533,"height":800}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uS9qxeCuP1WTYytdyQy9bydTgIi.j